  "releaseNotes": "0.6.5 reads HDR photos (JPEG gain maps: ISO 21496-1 and Apple HDR Gain Map) with DecoderOptions.LoadGainMap: image.ToHdr() reconstructs linear float pixels (HdrImage), hdr.ToneMap() converts to sRGB, and EditMetadata keeps gain map files intact. Loading without the option is unchanged. Notes: https://github.com/art-ix/PictureSharp/blob/v0.6.5/docs/releases/release-0.6.5.md",
